{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25132","headline":"美人梳头 · 张碧","name":"美人梳头","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉堂花院小枝红，绿窗一片春光晓。\n玉容惊觉浓睡醒，圆蟾挂出妆台表。\n金盘解下丛鬟碎，三尺巫云绾朝翠。\n皓指高低寸黛愁，水精梳滑参差坠。\n须臾拢掠蝉鬓生，玉钗冷透冬冰明。\n芙蓉拆向新开脸，秋泉慢转眸波横。\n鹦鹉偷来话心曲，屏风半倚遥山绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张碧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}